{"id":"d356be4fee142864","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-representation-theorem.md","title":"Representation Theorem","display":"thm-representation-theorem — Representation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-representation-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-representation-theorem"],"display":"thm-representation-theorem — Representation Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14 equation (1), p.49 / PDF 58; §8 normal form p.22 / PDF 31","verification_status":"source-adapted-theorem","source_proof_status":"source-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-representation-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-representation-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-representation-theorem — Representation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2517b868f96ae323\" href=\"?note=2517b868f96ae323\" title=\"68-df-kleene-t-predicate\">68-df-kleene-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14 equation (1), p.49 / PDF 58; §8 normal form p.22 / PDF 31"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-theorem"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2517b868f96ae323\" href=\"?note=2517b868f96ae323\" title=\"68-df-kleene-t-predicate\">68-df-kleene-t-predicate</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(A=W_e^{(k)}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_k(e,\\vec x,s))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(A=W_e^{(k)}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_k(e,\\vec x,s))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 §14，印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58 的式 (1)，依据 §8 Normal Form Theorem：W_e 是索引函数的定义域，而定义域成员性恰为存在终止计算记录。现显式保留 k，包括 k=0；k=1 即旧一元陈述。这里表述定义域的计算记录表示，并非全递归函数的值域枚举；后者需要非空条件，另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6b93664396291a47\" href=\"?note=6b93664396291a47\" title=\"68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem\">68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"2517b868f96ae323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$T_k$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"2517b868f96ae323","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$T_k$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$T_k$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"6b93664396291a47","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书 §14，印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58 的式 (1)，依据 §8 Normal Form Theorem：W_e 是索引函数的定义域，而定义域成员性恰为存在终止计算记录。现显式保留 k，包括 k=0；k=1 即旧一元陈述。这里表述定义域的计算记录表示，并非全递归函数的值域枚举；后者需要非空条件，另见 [[68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)},W_e^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"T_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k)}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(A=W_e^{(k)}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_k(e,\\vec x,s))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-representation-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-representation-theorem|thm-representation-theorem — Representation Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","2517b868f96ae323","bca7d0eca4017dc7","6b93664396291a47"]}